MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The wire connectors fit the hands-on wiring interest shown by my battery holder, jumper wires, and relay module, though waterproofing is not essential for every project.",
    "The digital caliper would help me measure boards, components, and mounting clearances, making it a useful companion to my electronics assembly supplies."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The polishing wheels and compounds assume a metal-finishing project and compatible equipment that my history does not establish. The selector switch also needs a specific application beyond my small electronics projects.",
    "The gloves, inspection mirror, and magnets lack an immediate use for me. The glove sizes are unconfirmed, and a thousand gloves would be excessive for my occasional project needs."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning workshop supplies seems to have been taken as interest in many kinds of workshop work, even when the recommended tools serve quite different tasks.",
    "My recent caster interaction seems to have been treated as a reason to choose another similar set, although I have no new furniture project requiring one."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated purchases of breadboards, wiring, boards, and a relay point toward small electronics assembly; usefulness within those projects matters more to me than a broad connection to tools or repairs.",
    "I choose project supplies when I have a concrete use for them. Compatibility, suitable quantities, and whether a recent purchase already fills the need affect whether I would choose something now."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly understood my electronics project interests but stretched them into workshop needs that I have not demonstrated."
}
